# Phase 5 transcript (DIFF-WRAP): a write of a new file whose lines are too
# long for the screen, each at the margin in another way -- a wide character
# (CJK, an emoji), an ESC and a U+202E fx spells (`\x1b`, `\u{202e}`), a tab
# before an overflow and one a cell short of the last column, a mark joined
# to the last column's character, a line that fills the row exactly, one
# that takes three. Ctrl-O over the change: fx reflows each line under its
# gutter (`reflowDiffRow`, transcript_blocks.zig:720-768@481104fd).
gateway p5-transcript-diffwrap-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
keep
wait 4
type write the file
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap edited
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key C-o
wait 1
snap closed
gwlog
